**Change made:** Moved the `registrationDate` defaulting out of the web layer and into `ClinicServiceImpl.saveOwner`, right beside the existing pre-save rule `assertTelephoneIsUnique(owner)`:

```java
public void saveOwner(Owner owner) throws DataAccessException {
    assertTelephoneIsUnique(owner);
